25", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618432_1155211816545958_1499975935670539211_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Yt3j-NhuRFoQ7kNvwF8GvhB&_nc_oc=AdpVI7Ac0WQKkRFtVdm2uPIDYewrxX07ZLZYikstfaTSRIZg97KJxTUJD9_YHn-pzRo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBCmE5piEKZosIplomMpg1Z5k_2S3eiycU_cwuVSzqYyA&oe=6A579FFB"}, {"file_name": "HKT_004.png", "id": "664955790017426", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618103_664955793350759_2648116165422297956_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_hApexb4B6QQ7kNvwGkCMUZ&_nc_oc=AdpJptWdq-uxsNNKLAFxtEdc08j0-8JykIh9zh9XA0M7OVFM0TaICtrkR6rUliacMBY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDjtRCXktxhR-yClYyApJ2KugTZ8Q0oD97H5-AZbMy0-w&oe=6A5798D6"}, {"file_name": "HKT_005.png", "id": "1154722276636474", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499626658_1154722283303140_5020928247130262911_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=78NFLwWmPbEQ7kNvwFnPWaN&_nc_oc=AdpUQhwzAL2FqZD_Hjg7jY58aoBvuBsaR8SrE9BuHfwM4vw1q1IDvyY7VWXRslsMY-w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCKv8mkCLNEjTt1rP3E4tE0Lei7pRBg1ESwedsCKrMkcQ&oe=6A578942"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Hello Kitty Skyland", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Hello Kitty Skyland is a social VR game that brings the charm of Sanrio into an expansive virtual world. Players from around the globe can gather in SKYLAND to meet friends, explore themed environments, and experience interactive encounters with Sanrio characters as immersive experiences only possible in VR.\n\nAs part of the growing metaverse, Skyland expands Sanrio\u2019s charm into a connected VR space where fans can come together across borders.\n\nEnjoy full-body multiplayer games that make play more active, expressive, and social than ever. Move naturally, play together, and share the fun in ways only possible in VR.\n\nChoose between two unique avatar styles:\n\t\u2022\tSkyMe: a humanoid avatar offering deep customization and dress-up options, perfect for expressing individuality and style.\n\t\u2022\tPluffee: an original, rounded avatar designed for smooth, dynamic movement and playful expression.\n\nSeamlessly switch between both avatars to enjoy the best of personalization, multiplayer fun, and exploration. Whether you\u2019re customizing your look, joining full-body games, or simply relaxing with friends, Hello Kitty Skyland offers a joyful social experience that celebrates creativity, connection, and the world of Sanrio, all in VR.", "short_description": "Step into Hello Kitty Skyland, a vibrant social VR world in the metaverse where Sanrio fans and a new generation of Social VR and action game fans around the globe can connect, play, and explore. Customize your avatar, interact with beloved Sanrio characters, and enjoy full-body multiplayer games that make play more active, expressive, and social than ever. Switch seamlessly between two unique avatar styles, express yourself in SkyMe or move freely as Pluffee, for a VR experience like no other."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "706515941894982", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Hello Kitty Skyland", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u300eHello Kitty Skyland\u300f\u306f\u30b5\u30f3\u30ea\u30aa\u30ad\u30e3\u30e9\u30af\u30bf\u30fc\u30ba\u306e\u30e1\u30bf\u30d0\u30fc\u30b9\u3092\u821e\u53f0\u306b\u3057\u305f\u30bd\u30fc\u30b7\u30e3\u30ebVR\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3067\u3059\u3002\u201dSKYLAND\u201d\u3068\u547c\u3070\u308c\u308b\u4eee\u60f3\u7a7a\u9593\u306b\u4e16\u754c\u4e2d\u306e\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u30e4\u30fc\u304c\u96c6\u307e\u308a\u3001\u30b5\u30f3\u30ea\u30aa\u30ad\u30e3\u30e9\u30af\u30bf\u30fc\u305f\u3061\u3068\u306e\u30a4\u30de\u30fc\u30b7\u30d6\u306a\u51fa\u4f1a\u3044\u306b\u52a0\u3048\u3001\u8eab\u4f53\u5168\u4f53\u30